{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friendly neighborhood soft drink corporation has been polluting the ocean and mutating the local sea life, just as the 80s' newest upcoming band BLUEBERRY FINN is entering town for a show. Hank and Duck need to split up if they're going to stop the evil that is afoot, and save all the beach-goers from being jellied!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951630/extras/4652ea67913f14aea012dffc3e068fdc.poster.avif?t=1758011866\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951630/extras/4652ea67913f14aea012dffc3e068fdc.webm?t=1758011866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the Jellyfish is a point-and-click comedy adventure game featuring original pixel-art and music, quirky puzzles, and fully voice acted dialogue. The story revolves around two protagonists, Hank and Duck, who only showed up in town to put on a rockin' concert, but ended up smack dab in the middle of a mutating fizzy-based pollution catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951630/extras/431efd969d3f3366bc8e02c97c8cd939.webp?t=1758011866\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951630/extras/4e14b432a8c5b6c9a244800264c66f83.webp?t=1758011866\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play as TWO different characters, classic adventure game style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- AQUA based puzzles that will get stuck in your brain for hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Learn about the environment and what to do to protect it!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Feel like you are in '80 again! (Or for the first time. I'm looking at you, Generation Z).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Defeat the Evil Jellyfish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful OST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cabot Cove","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951630/e090f8efe17466f67fc47bf0d368803656b31c2d.jpg"},{"name":"Sonic Boom!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951630/06712d72e281dff8e8c5a7bfff5d62f0dd0aeeb3.jpg"},{"name":"Very C-lever!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951630/bc909265084cce3740bb4cd4d187c8cc8d60b0ea.jpg"},{"name":"You\u2019re fired!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951630/b008e80c9e20bf5a4684ae25248f4317626b7c75.jpg"},{"name":"For Alex!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951630/ef3abec05874ad942d89d4ee3aa47f9d2d9c83da.jpg"},{"name":"Geneva convection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951630/4b8fa357099cfa1a02ef92fa1675ad7ce34ee4e8.jpg"},{"name":"Globophobia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951630/ee02199e6cac384ff18f4837555088595dbb4c95.jpg"},{"name":"Say friend and enter.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951630/f162438190cf1c6eda11e23f68fb4e857fe297ea.jpg"},{"name":"Aqua Puzzle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951630/876226df6b449925566f542d20b8d4c183ade252.jpg"},{"name":"Chemical reaction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3951630/76bfcb1add903ae9e1548d580dab4ee0193b6a